# A higher fill raises the mean index and tilts the beam forward.
# Reference: the grating equation.
title Fill factor 0.3 at a fixed 630 nm period
grating period=0.63 fill=0.3 length=20
expect n_grating 2.63187936 2e-07
expect period 0.63000000 1e-07
expect angle 6.82343967 1e-05
expect orders 1
expect second_order 1.65808400 1e-06
expect dtheta_dlambda -0.08784072 0.001
